WEBVTT

01:53.800 --> 01:57.300
What should I do? Someone might come...

01:57.930 --> 01:59.470
I can't...

01:59.470 --> 02:00.680
go to sleep...

02:24.040 --> 02:25.290
YEEART!

02:29.040 --> 02:31.670
Are you a NINJA?

02:31.670 --> 02:34.460
DŌMO. I am Yamoto Koki.

02:35.250 --> 02:38.550
DŌMO. I am GENOCIDE.

02:35.250 --> 02:38.550
NOTE: GENOCIDE is the deliberate killing of a large group of people.

02:39.930 --> 02:42.720
What the hell are you doing here, kid?

02:42.720 --> 02:44.180
Are you a SŌKAIYA NINJA?

02:44.180 --> 02:45.890
Did you say SŌKAIYA?

02:45.890 --> 02:47.310
Hell no, kid.

02:48.890 --> 02:50.350
You want to do some KARATE?

02:50.350 --> 02:51.690
Kill each other?

02:51.690 --> 02:54.230
You and me? Right here? That's fine with me.

03:00.030 --> 03:02.620
Shh... a NINJA?

03:04.030 --> 03:05.490
Never mind.

03:07.250 --> 03:09.500
My brain's going.

03:09.500 --> 03:11.540
I forget things.

03:21.800 --> 03:24.260
What are you doing?

03:24.600 --> 03:28.730
If I leave her be, this old lady's gonna rot.

03:28.730 --> 03:30.020
Like me.

03:30.350 --> 03:31.560
Who is she?

03:31.890 --> 03:34.770
The old lady who lived here.

03:34.770 --> 03:38.440
I didn't kill her. It must've just been her time.

03:39.490 --> 03:43.160
She was lying in there, dead, when I got here.

03:43.160 --> 03:45.410
I'm not into sleeping with corpses.

03:48.620 --> 03:51.160
WE FAILED TO CAPTURE HIM AGAIN?!

03:51.160 --> 03:55.710
GENOCIDE! I made that ZOMBIE NINJA,

03:51.160 --> 03:55.710
NOTE: ZOMBIE NINJAS combine the power of DEAD THINGS and NINJAS.

03:55.710 --> 04:00.090
but he gained self-awareness and destroyed my lab!

04:00.090 --> 04:02.220
And then he ran away!

04:03.550 --> 04:06.350
I need to catch him no matter what,

04:06.350 --> 04:12.560
or the stress might damage my brain cells!

04:12.560 --> 04:16.400
That's horrible! You can't lose your intelligence, doctor!

04:16.400 --> 04:18.820
However, Fubuki-KUN!

04:18.820 --> 04:21.190
During the IKUSA following his attempted capture,

04:21.190 --> 04:24.700
GENOCIDE proved that he's special!

04:24.950 --> 04:27.620
ON A PERSONAL LEVEL,
that makes me very happy.

04:27.620 --> 04:30.910
Oh, no! You mustn't mix private thoughts with your work!

04:30.910 --> 04:34.790
That's why I've made a new NINJA already!

04:34.790 --> 04:35.790
Huh?

04:36.420 --> 04:38.710
HUH?! Is this your doing?

04:38.710 --> 04:40.840
MANTICORE? It's done?

04:40.840 --> 04:41.710
Already?

04:41.710 --> 04:45.970
And I've determined where GENOCIDE is hiding!

04:45.970 --> 04:48.930
WELL DONE! THAT'S MY GIRL!

04:48.930 --> 04:51.020
Oh, please wait!

04:51.020 --> 04:54.440
There's a SŌKAIYA NINJA in the same zone!

05:22.760 --> 05:23.800
So...

05:23.800 --> 05:28.010
Your name's... Yamoto?

05:28.010 --> 05:29.430
So, Yamoto-SAN.

05:30.140 --> 05:33.020
SŌKAIYA NINJAS are after you?

05:34.810 --> 05:36.890
I've got enemies, too.

05:36.890 --> 05:39.650
And they'll find this place soon.

05:44.240 --> 05:46.030
Want some?

06:01.710 --> 06:03.000
Nah.

06:03.750 --> 06:07.510
Hey... were you a priest?

06:07.510 --> 06:09.930
You ever seen a priest like me?

06:09.930 --> 06:14.220
I just took the CASSOCK from a priest.

06:09.930 --> 06:14.220
NOTE: A CASSOCK is a SOUTANE.

06:15.470 --> 06:18.100
I don't really remember it anymore.

06:19.690 --> 06:21.860
I forget things.

06:21.860 --> 06:23.820
Most things.

06:25.780 --> 06:29.360
Where did the priest go?

06:29.360 --> 06:31.370
Couldn't say.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.540
Tired?

06:40.540 --> 06:42.250
You haven't slept, right?

06:42.250 --> 06:44.000
I'm fine.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.710
Sleep.

06:45.710 --> 06:47.510
I don't sleep anymore.

06:47.510 --> 06:49.470
If something happens, I'll wake you up.

06:54.260 --> 06:57.430
Hey. Sleep upstairs.

06:57.430 --> 06:59.230
There's a bed.

07:08.070 --> 07:11.530
Get to the top of the tower, and take a look at the enemy!

07:14.160 --> 07:15.790
They're here!

07:15.790 --> 07:16.790
From the front!

07:21.370 --> 07:22.750
Mass murder! Mass murder! Mass murder! Mass murder! Mass murder! Mass murder! Mass murder! Mass murder!

07:22.580 --> 07:23.920
GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH!

07:29.420 --> 07:30.420
Mass murder!

07:30.880 --> 07:32.260
GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH!

07:35.890 --> 07:37.010
GWARGH!

07:36.430 --> 07:37.770
Mass...

07:37.770 --> 07:38.850
YEEART!

07:39.680 --> 07:41.730
GWAAAAARGH!

07:44.310 --> 07:45.520
Behold!

07:45.520 --> 07:49.610
Lake careless spaceships that
wandered into an asteroid belt,

07:49.610 --> 07:53.030
the CLONE YAKUZA are helpless before the onslaught!

07:53.030 --> 07:55.910
GWAAAARRGGHHHHH!

08:03.540 --> 08:05.540
Die, asshole!

08:05.540 --> 08:07.630
Yeah, asshole!

08:08.670 --> 08:12.720
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE. I am GRENADIER.

08:08.670 --> 08:12.720
NOTE: A GRENADIER is a common
bottom-dwelling fish with a large head.

08:12.720 --> 08:16.010
DŌMO, GRENADIER-SAN.

08:16.010 --> 08:18.220
I am GENOCIDE.

08:21.100 --> 08:22.600
Don't let him get close!

08:22.600 --> 08:23.310
YEEART!

08:23.310 --> 08:24.690
GWAARGGH!

08:25.310 --> 08:26.190
YEEART!

08:26.190 --> 08:27.440
GWARGH!

08:28.230 --> 08:30.860
I'll just keep going until you're dead!

08:33.280 --> 08:35.990
You can't win!

08:35.990 --> 08:37.240
YEEART!

08:37.240 --> 08:38.950
GWAARGHH!

08:39.830 --> 08:42.250
Hey, what's going on up there!

08:42.660 --> 08:45.790
Another NINJA... He's coming!

08:48.250 --> 08:51.550
Ouchies!

08:51.550 --> 08:56.390
ROOOAAAAR!

08:57.930 --> 09:00.720
DŌMO. I am MANTICORE.

09:00.720 --> 09:03.480
What? MANTICORE?

09:03.480 --> 09:05.520
Who the hell is he?

09:07.060 --> 09:07.980
YEEART!

09:07.980 --> 09:09.440
GWAARRRGH!

09:09.440 --> 09:10.610
YEEART!

09:13.780 --> 09:14.740
Mass murder!

09:16.240 --> 09:17.200
YEEART!

09:17.200 --> 09:18.870
GWARGH!

09:19.780 --> 09:21.240
YEEART!

09:21.620 --> 09:23.870
GWAARGHH!

09:26.750 --> 09:30.840
DŌMO, GRENADIER-SAN.
I am Yamoto Koki.

09:30.840 --> 09:35.170
DŌMO, Yamoto Koki-SAN.
I am GRENADIER.

09:35.170 --> 09:36.800
You're making me work hard.

09:36.800 --> 09:41.140
But it's impossible to escape from SŌKAIYA.

09:41.810 --> 09:42.520
AIYEARGGH!

09:42.520 --> 09:44.640
Mass! Murder!

09:44.980 --> 09:47.520
ᗅ-ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

09:47.520 --> 09:48.980
SAYŌNARA!

09:49.610 --> 09:50.520
YEEART!

09:50.520 --> 09:51.900
YEEART!!

09:54.610 --> 09:58.030
You're Lee-SENSEI's new toy, aren't you?

09:58.030 --> 09:59.950
Me kill you!

09:59.950 --> 10:02.540
Take back body!

10:02.540 --> 10:04.750
Heh. Not happening!

10:04.750 --> 10:05.960
YEEART!

10:11.630 --> 10:14.300
Kill you both!

10:22.350 --> 10:23.850
GENOCIDE-SAN!

10:24.180 --> 10:25.930
I'm a ZOMBIE!

10:25.930 --> 10:27.850
What about you? Can you do this?

10:30.230 --> 10:31.900
I'm fine. I can do this.

10:31.900 --> 10:34.280
Great. Bring the pain!

10:37.280 --> 10:39.280
YEEART!

10:46.450 --> 10:48.710
GWAAARGGHH!

10:48.710 --> 10:51.130
Ouchies!

10:53.960 --> 10:54.800
YEEART!

10:54.800 --> 10:57.210
ZOMBIE weak!

10:57.550 --> 11:01.640
Compare strength and me win!

11:02.140 --> 11:05.510
Take back body!

11:05.510 --> 11:07.060
No.

11:13.860 --> 11:16.230
What?

11:16.230 --> 11:19.610
GWAARGHH!

11:20.110 --> 11:21.200
I...

11:24.490 --> 11:26.080
I am GENOCIDE!

11:27.790 --> 11:29.330
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

11:29.330 --> 11:31.170
SAYŌNARA!

11:35.040 --> 11:36.710
AAHHHH!

11:36.710 --> 11:39.340
MANTICORE couldn't do it either?!

11:39.340 --> 11:41.050
It's my fault!

11:41.050 --> 11:43.430
If only I'd coordinated better with SŌKAIYA...

11:43.430 --> 11:49.310
I don't mind! I've got a wonderful update on GENOCIDE's combat data!

11:49.310 --> 11:52.350
Genocide... He's so wonderful! WHAT DO I DO?!

11:53.310 --> 11:57.400
Genocide! The mass murder NINJA! Next time! Next time!

11:57.400 --> 11:59.900
FUBUKI-KUN! FUBUKI-KUN!

11:59.900 --> 12:02.400
I don't think I can... I don't...

12:02.400 --> 12:04.410
I can't... I couldn't.

12:07.620 --> 12:09.450
If you're gonna leave, now's your chance.

12:09.450 --> 12:11.710
Before they come back.

12:13.960 --> 12:15.080
After this...

12:15.080 --> 12:17.750
My brain's just about rotted.

12:17.750 --> 12:19.630
If we ever meet again,

12:19.630 --> 12:23.260
don't hate me if I don't recognize you.

12:23.260 --> 12:24.680
Okay.

12:24.680 --> 12:25.890
Yeah.
